sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Watcher as Watcher Threads (Autonomic)
    participant UI as Open WebUI (The Mouth)
    participant Router as Agentic Router (The Mind)
    participant Redis as Redis (The Thalamus)
    participant MCP as MCP Services (The Senses)
    participant VDB as pgvector (The Hippocampus)
    participant Engine as Ollama / RTX 5080 (The Muscle)

    Note over Watcher, Redis: --- ASYNCHRONOUS RECONCILIATION LOOP ---
    Watcher->>MCP: Polling: "Audit latest Git commit"
    MCP-->>Watcher: Return: Code changes + Summary
    Watcher->>VDB: Query: "Get YC coding standards"
    VDB-->>Watcher: Return: Playbook snippet
    Watcher->>Engine: Reasoning: "Does this commit drift?"
    Engine-->>Watcher: Result: "Drift detected (Auth bypass)"
    Watcher->>Redis: Update: Set status="Warning" + score=0.6

    Note over UI, Engine: --- SYNCHRONOUS USER REQUEST ---
    UI->>Router: "How is my startup doing today?"
    
    %% Parallel Data Fetching
    par Parallel Gather
        Router->>Redis: Get: Current Health Object (Vital Signs)
        Router->>VDB: Get: Recent historical context (Memory)
        Router->>MCP: Get: Live market data (Perception)
    end

    %% Contextual Injection
    Note over Router, Engine: Router bundles 'Vital Signs' + 'Memory' + 'Perception'
    Router->>Engine: POST /api/generate (The One Big Call)
    Engine-->>Router: "Based on your 0.6 score and the recent Auth bypass..."
    
    Router-->>UI: Streaming Response